  "application_type_full": "Approval of details reserved by a condition (discharge)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The information submitted in relation to Conditions 29 and 30 is insufficient to demonstrate that the development would operate in accordance with sustainable transport objectives. The submitted Delivery and Servicing Plan remains in draft form and relates only to the commercial unit, with no details provided for the residential element of the development. Similarly, the submitted Travel Plan does not include the required modal shift targets or baseline mode share data and fails to provide a separate action plan for the residential units. As such, there is insufficient information to demonstrate that the transport impacts of the development can be appropriately managed and monitored. In addition, Condition 26 can only be partially discharged, as the associated highway works have not yet been completed. Accordingly, the application cannot be fully discharged and fails to demonstrate compliance with the requirements of Local Plan Policy EC2."
  ],
  "decision": "Refused",
